WEBVTT

00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:03.730
I would definitely like you
to audition for a role, Ichinose-san.

00:00:03.730 --> 00:00:05.230
Huh?!

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:08.130
Ichinose Futaba-san, please come in.

00:00:08.130 --> 00:00:09.400
Okay!

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:12.640
I am Ichinose Futaba from Aozora Production!

00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:14.820
l am auditioning for the role of lsnella.

00:00:15.510 --> 00:00:17.530
I wonder when we'll find out about the results?

00:00:17.530 --> 00:00:21.640
Next week if they're fast.
Maybe in a month if they're slow?

00:00:25.170 --> 00:00:27.780
Please. Please!

00:00:27.780 --> 00:00:32.170
I beg of you! Please let me
hear that I got the part...!

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:40.600
No one's calling...

00:00:41.790 --> 00:00:44.120
For the audition I went to the other day,

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:47.420
Konno-san said they'd have the results
sometime this week.

00:00:49.590 --> 00:00:51.010
But I haven't heard anything!

00:00:51.010 --> 00:00:53.510
Does that mean I didn't get the part after all?

00:00:55.340 --> 00:00:56.740
I can't wait any longer!

00:00:56.740 --> 00:00:59.330
I'm going to call her!

00:01:03.330 --> 00:01:04.850
A call!

00:01:04.850 --> 00:01:07.020
Th-This is Ichinose Futaba.

00:01:07.020 --> 00:01:08.440
Oh, this is Konno.

00:01:08.440 --> 00:01:09.780
I am calling about work.

00:01:10.730 --> 00:01:15.860
This week's web radio recording
will start 30 minutes earlier than usual.

00:01:15.860 --> 00:01:17.280
Um, right.

00:01:17.970 --> 00:01:18.780
Also...

00:01:18.780 --> 00:01:19.580
Also!

00:01:20.040 --> 00:01:22.290
About the audition the other day.

00:01:22.290 --> 00:01:23.870
Here it is!

00:01:34.440 --> 00:01:36.600
About the audition the other day,
you didn't get the part.

00:03:13.490 --> 00:03:17.290
Aw, I really wanted to play the part of lsnella.

00:03:17.290 --> 00:03:19.540
The manga was interesting, too.

00:03:19.540 --> 00:03:21.470
I wonder who will play her?

00:03:21.470 --> 00:03:24.250
I know how you feel-koro.

00:03:24.250 --> 00:03:25.490
Besides-

00:03:25.490 --> 00:03:27.420
This is really bad!

00:03:27.420 --> 00:03:29.720
There are only two recording
sessions left for Bodhisattvon!

00:03:29.720 --> 00:03:34.220
The web radio will end soon, too,
and then I'll be out of a job!

00:03:34.220 --> 00:03:36.010
I'm sure it'll be fine-koro!

00:03:36.010 --> 00:03:40.310
You'll get some work before
recording for Bodhisattvon ends-koro!

00:03:42.310 --> 00:03:45.120
Yeah, you're right.

00:03:48.320 --> 00:03:48.390
Bodhisattvon!

00:03:48.390 --> 00:03:49.640
<b>Boy
Bodhisattvon!</b>

00:03:49.640 --> 00:03:50.690
Bodhisattvon!

00:03:50.690 --> 00:03:53.950
The people shall not be sad.

00:03:53.950 --> 00:03:57.580
I will become light that will shine
upon the world far and wide,

00:03:57.580 --> 00:04:00.130
and be with you all forever.

00:04:02.570 --> 00:04:02.920
<b>Boy</b>

00:04:02.920 --> 00:04:03.450
Bodhisattvon...
<b>Boy</b>

00:04:03.450 --> 00:04:04.210
Bodhisattvon...

00:04:07.710 --> 00:04:14.890
And, cut. Okay, with this, all the recording
for the last episode of Bodhisattvon is over.

00:04:14.890 --> 00:04:16.550
Thanks for your hard work!

00:04:16.550 --> 00:04:18.730
Thanks for your hard work.

00:04:29.530 --> 00:04:32.950
In the end, I didn't get any other work...

00:04:33.620 --> 00:04:35.780
<b>Kazukageya Coffee Shop</b>

00:04:35.790 --> 00:04:36.780
<b>Buddha Fighter Bodhisattvon</b>

00:04:36.780 --> 00:04:37.420
It's over at last, huh?
<b>Buddha Fighter Bodhisattvon</b>

00:04:37.420 --> 00:04:38.660
It's over at last, huh?

00:04:38.660 --> 00:04:39.640
Yeah...

00:04:40.040 --> 00:04:43.830
It was fun with the three of us together.
It's too bad it's over.

00:04:43.830 --> 00:04:44.760
Yeah.

00:04:46.540 --> 00:04:49.710
Hm? You seem strange, Futaba.

00:04:49.710 --> 00:04:54.760
I mean, I loved the studio for Bodhisattvon,
but I can't go anymore.

00:04:54.760 --> 00:04:58.050
And once the web radio is over,
I'm out of a job.

00:04:58.050 --> 00:04:58.770
Huh?

00:04:59.220 --> 00:05:02.610
I didn't get the part from
the audition the other day.

00:05:02.610 --> 00:05:04.730
Oh, I didn't either.

00:05:04.730 --> 00:05:06.110
I didn't get the part, either.

00:05:07.270 --> 00:05:10.370
I see, none of us got chosen, huh?

00:05:10.370 --> 00:05:12.780
I'm at twelve straight losses now...

00:05:12.780 --> 00:05:15.990
I didn't get the part for the
audition after that, either.

00:05:15.990 --> 00:05:18.700
But you have other regular roles,
don't you, Rin?

00:05:18.700 --> 00:05:20.450
Um, yeah, two.

00:05:22.210 --> 00:05:25.790
Aren't you jealous that she
still has work coming up, lchigo?

00:05:25.790 --> 00:05:27.580
I have something, too!

00:05:27.580 --> 00:05:28.140
Huh?!

00:05:28.420 --> 00:05:33.260
I don't have another regular role yet,
but I've got a one-shot narration job!

00:05:33.260 --> 00:05:35.350
Wow, lucky...

00:05:38.380 --> 00:05:40.360
Today's Schedule
Moesaki Ichigo

00:05:41.650 --> 00:05:45.270
Welcome, welcome to
Super Cheap Supermarket, Surprisedo!

00:05:45.270 --> 00:05:45.920
You'll be surprised at how cheap it is!

00:05:45.920 --> 00:05:47.350
Super Cheap Supermarket,
Surprisedo Narration Script

00:05:47.350 --> 00:05:48.910
On Mondays, milk! Tuesdays, eggs!

00:05:49.270 --> 00:05:50.940
On Wednesdays, bread is on sale!

00:05:50.940 --> 00:05:55.160
On Thursdays, meat! Fridays, fish!
And on Saturdays, we have super sales!

00:05:55.940 --> 00:05:58.950
Th-This is a kind of narration, too, right?

00:05:58.950 --> 00:06:01.280
Okay, thank you! Good work!

00:06:03.250 --> 00:06:06.160
It was over in ten minutes...

00:06:06.760 --> 00:06:08.760
Japanese Confectionery Kohana-ya

00:06:09.630 --> 00:06:13.220
Futaba-san and lchigo-san said they were jealous of me,

00:06:13.550 --> 00:06:16.810
but working and going
to school at the same time...!

00:06:17.300 --> 00:06:20.560
It's almost time for midterms!

00:06:22.390 --> 00:06:26.020
Yay! I have a ton of stuff
to do this month, too!

00:06:26.020 --> 00:06:29.110
Futaba-san, that's all for your part-time job-koro!

00:06:32.650 --> 00:06:36.240
What'll I do starting next month?! What'll I do?

00:06:42.570 --> 00:06:46.130
I really liked Bodhisattvon.

00:06:46.130 --> 00:06:48.470
It was a good show-koro.

00:06:48.960 --> 00:06:53.880
I was shocked when Pipo broke
after just three episodes, though.

00:06:53.880 --> 00:06:56.090
I wanted to do more.

00:06:56.090 --> 00:06:57.970
Pipo running all out-

00:06:57.970 --> 00:06:59.190
Pipo!

00:06:59.190 --> 00:07:01.430
Pipo acting proud-

00:07:01.430 --> 00:07:02.560
Pipo.

00:07:02.850 --> 00:07:04.350
Angry Pipo-

00:07:04.350 --> 00:07:06.070
Pipo!

00:07:09.690 --> 00:07:13.070
I think I let my guard down...

00:07:13.730 --> 00:07:16.150
I got my first regular role on Bodhisattvon,

00:07:16.150 --> 00:07:18.860
and even got a web radio show.

00:07:18.860 --> 00:07:24.210
Everything was going so smoothly
that I felt like I would always have work.

00:07:27.490 --> 00:07:30.870
What if I don't get
any other work after this...?

00:07:32.660 --> 00:07:34.640
Calling Konno-san

00:07:35.900 --> 00:07:38.050
Yes, this is Ichinose Futaba.

00:07:38.050 --> 00:07:39.880
Oh, this is Konno.

00:07:39.880 --> 00:07:41.020
I am calling about work.

00:07:41.720 --> 00:07:44.760
The date and time for the wrap party
for Bodhisattvon has been decided.

00:07:44.760 --> 00:07:48.030
Uh, right...

00:07:51.310 --> 00:07:56.980
The wrap party is like a party to thank everyone
for their hard work after the show is over-koro.

00:07:56.980 --> 00:07:59.070
Staff and cast members give speeches,

00:07:59.070 --> 00:08:04.000
and there are raffles or
bingo tournaments with prizes-koro.

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:08.330
There are so many staff members
involved in making anime...

00:08:08.330 --> 00:08:11.250
Yes! I always think it's amazing.

00:08:11.250 --> 00:08:13.680
'Cause we don't usually get to meet them.

00:08:13.680 --> 00:08:19.170
Aw man, this means
Bodhisattvon is really over, huh?

00:08:19.170 --> 00:08:22.090
The wrap party is always a little sad.

00:08:23.760 --> 00:08:26.800
I'm going to get a little more pasta.

00:08:26.800 --> 00:08:28.100
Oh, okay.

00:08:28.100 --> 00:08:30.680
Even if we're sad, we still get hungry.

00:08:31.690 --> 00:08:33.100
Excuse me.

00:08:34.170 --> 00:08:35.210
I'm sorry...

00:08:36.150 --> 00:08:37.870
Oh, sorry!

00:08:38.480 --> 00:08:39.730
That's all right.

00:08:42.200 --> 00:08:44.460
G-Ginga Banjo-san!

00:08:44.460 --> 00:08:46.910
l-l'm so sorry!

00:08:46.910 --> 00:08:49.120
Oh no, I'm sorry, too.

00:08:49.120 --> 00:08:51.200
Oh, forgive me for not
introducing myself earlier.

00:08:51.200 --> 00:08:55.040
I played the part of Pipo,
my name is Ichinose Futaba!

00:08:55.040 --> 00:08:56.840
Thank you for your support
during the recording sessions.

00:08:56.840 --> 00:09:01.100
Oh, thanks for your hard work.
It was a good show, wasn't it?

00:09:01.800 --> 00:09:06.350
Yes! But my character,
Pipo, died really early...

00:09:07.010 --> 00:09:10.850
I don't know how many times I've died already.

00:09:10.850 --> 00:09:15.600
Getting shot from behind,
or cut down by a hero...

00:09:15.600 --> 00:09:18.060
You know, in times like that, I say,

00:09:18.060 --> 00:09:22.150
if I'm gonna die, then I'll
show them a wonderful death!

00:09:22.150 --> 00:09:24.650
Whether it's the main character,
or a character who dies,

00:09:24.650 --> 00:09:26.490
they're all roles we play, right?

00:09:26.490 --> 00:09:28.950
So we've gotta die with all we have. Right?

00:09:30.560 --> 00:09:31.600
Yes!

00:09:31.600 --> 00:09:32.510
Ginga-san!

00:09:33.660 --> 00:09:36.330
Please do your best from now on, too.

00:09:36.330 --> 00:09:37.540
See you later.

00:09:37.540 --> 00:09:39.140
Thank you very much!

00:09:43.340 --> 00:09:44.590
Bodhisattvon...

00:09:47.470 --> 00:09:49.650
Yes! I'll do my best!

00:09:49.650 --> 00:09:52.470
Now, let's start the bingo tournament!

00:09:55.640 --> 00:09:58.400
Number 16! 16!

00:10:03.170 --> 00:10:03.990
And so...

00:10:04.480 --> 00:10:11.620
After three months of bringing you <i>Radio
Bodhisattvon: Trying the Patience of Bodhisattvon,</i>

00:10:11.620 --> 00:10:14.330
it is now time for us to part.

00:10:14.330 --> 00:10:17.120
Everyone, thanks for everything!

00:10:17.120 --> 00:10:18.880
Thank you very much!

00:10:19.210 --> 00:10:22.170
Really, thanks!

00:10:22.170 --> 00:10:24.390
This has been Ichinose Futaba,

00:10:24.840 --> 00:10:26.720
Moesaki Ichigo,

00:10:26.720 --> 00:10:28.890
and Kohana Rin.

00:10:28.890 --> 00:10:30.720
Okay, great.

00:10:32.050 --> 00:10:35.890
Aw, the radio show's over now, too.

00:10:35.890 --> 00:10:40.190
Yeah, we have to work hard to get our next job.

00:10:40.190 --> 00:10:43.700
I hope the three of us can
work together again sometime!

00:10:44.360 --> 00:10:47.070
Hey, good work, good work.

00:10:48.030 --> 00:10:49.240
Kaibara-san!

00:10:49.240 --> 00:10:50.960
Thanks for your hard work!

00:10:52.070 --> 00:10:55.920
Actually, I came today with something
important to discuss with you three.

00:10:56.750 --> 00:10:57.500
Huh?

00:10:57.500 --> 00:10:58.370
Something important...

00:10:58.370 --> 00:10:59.750
...to discuss?

00:10:59.750 --> 00:11:00.580
Reprimands?

00:11:00.580 --> 00:11:01.710
Compliments?

00:11:01.710 --> 00:11:03.220
Snacks?

00:11:05.210 --> 00:11:08.300
Actually, this web radio show will...

00:11:08.300 --> 00:11:12.930
Guess what, guess what?! It will continue!

00:11:12.930 --> 00:11:13.430
Huh?

00:11:13.430 --> 00:11:14.100
What?

00:11:14.100 --> 00:11:15.480
Really?

00:11:15.480 --> 00:11:19.680
Well, you girls have somehow
gotten better at talking on the radio,

00:11:19.680 --> 00:11:22.940
and it's getting more and more plays online.

00:11:22.940 --> 00:11:27.230
So we've decided to change the title and continue!

00:11:27.230 --> 00:11:28.250
Hm?

00:11:28.690 --> 00:11:30.400
Oh, good...

00:11:30.400 --> 00:11:32.040
I'm so glad!

00:11:32.040 --> 00:11:34.160
Yup, yup, yup.

00:11:34.160 --> 00:11:37.620
And then, there's something even more important.

00:11:37.620 --> 00:11:38.170
Huh?

00:11:38.480 --> 00:11:41.180
Actually...

00:11:44.460 --> 00:11:46.130
Guess what, guess what?

00:11:46.130 --> 00:11:50.260
We're having you three form a unit!

00:11:50.260 --> 00:11:51.680
A unit?

00:11:51.680 --> 00:11:53.770
A unit? Finally!

00:11:54.720 --> 00:11:58.650
I have! Been waiting! For this moment!

00:11:58.650 --> 00:12:01.810
It has been a few years since I left
the udon country where I was born.

00:12:01.810 --> 00:12:06.230
Since the day I became a strawberry princess,
my goal has been to become an idol seiyuu!

00:12:06.230 --> 00:12:08.490
Forming a unit is a huge first step toward that!

00:12:08.900 --> 00:12:11.820
Thank you so much!
I will give it everything I've got!

00:12:11.820 --> 00:12:13.750
That's great. That's the spirit!

00:12:14.110 --> 00:12:17.040
Um, what does a unit do?

00:12:17.040 --> 00:12:22.000
Hm? Well, first, you'll have your CD debut
with the new radio show's theme song.

00:12:22.000 --> 00:12:23.760
Yay, a CD debut!

00:12:23.760 --> 00:12:24.980
Huh?

00:12:26.150 --> 00:12:27.100
A CD?!

00:12:27.370 --> 00:12:29.810
That's right. You three will sing it.

00:12:32.220 --> 00:12:37.550
Huh? Huh? Huh, huh? Huh...?!

00:12:46.840 --> 00:12:51.700
A CD debut... We're going to have a CD debut...?

00:12:52.010 --> 00:12:55.970
Oh, I can't wait to see what kind
of unit you girls turn out to be.

00:12:55.970 --> 00:13:01.520
Oh right, Kaibara-san, since we're forming a unit,
that means we'll need a unit name, right?

00:13:01.520 --> 00:13:02.880
Oh, that's right.

00:13:03.310 --> 00:13:04.480
A unit name?

00:13:04.480 --> 00:13:07.010
We're going to start right off with the name?

00:13:07.280 --> 00:13:09.240
The name is super important!

00:13:09.240 --> 00:13:11.720
The name is what'll decide our image!

00:13:13.930 --> 00:13:16.450
So, I thought about it, and-

00:13:16.450 --> 00:13:17.810
Oh? What's your idea?

00:13:17.810 --> 00:13:21.860
Ta-da! We're a unit
of newbies, so "Baby Berries"!

00:13:22.120 --> 00:13:25.630
Wait a minute. Doesn't "berry"
refer to strawberries, lchigo?

00:13:25.630 --> 00:13:27.960
Isn't it great? Strawberries are cute.

00:13:27.960 --> 00:13:29.170
Baby Berries...

00:13:29.170 --> 00:13:32.590
Um, since there are three of us,
what about "Wasanbon"?

00:13:32.590 --> 00:13:33.790
Wasanbon...?

00:13:34.090 --> 00:13:36.810
Is that the sugar used in Japanese sweets?

00:13:36.810 --> 00:13:39.310
Rin-chan, your family makes Japanese sweets, right?

00:13:39.310 --> 00:13:41.500
What, is that why you're
pushing the Japanese stuff?

00:13:41.770 --> 00:13:45.270
Th-That's not how it is...

00:13:45.270 --> 00:13:47.940
Futaba-san, what name do you think would be good?

00:13:47.940 --> 00:13:48.610
Huh?!

00:13:48.610 --> 00:13:51.010
Uh... I... um...

00:13:51.280 --> 00:13:53.450
Come on, there's gotta be something, right?

00:13:53.450 --> 00:13:54.520
Please tell us.

00:13:54.820 --> 00:14:02.520
Um... Since we're three seiyuu,
how about "Voice Actress the Third"!

00:14:05.210 --> 00:14:06.920
Um, Futaba-san...

00:14:06.920 --> 00:14:07.570
Yes?

00:14:07.840 --> 00:14:11.010
That would make it "Seiyuu III."

00:14:13.900 --> 00:14:19.000
It's fine, it's fine. Actually, I've
already decided on the name of the unit.

00:14:19.260 --> 00:14:21.500
Oh? What kind of name is it?

00:14:21.810 --> 00:14:23.980
You are still newcomers,

00:14:23.980 --> 00:14:31.030
but your fresh voices can sound
close to and resonate with the listeners.

00:14:31.030 --> 00:14:37.390
That's right. Like you are singing
into their ears, just for them.

00:14:39.740 --> 00:14:41.400
That's why, I call you-

00:14:41.700 --> 00:14:42.900
You call us?

00:14:47.210 --> 00:14:49.400
"Earphones."

00:14:52.440 --> 00:14:53.880
Huh ?

00:14:53.880 --> 00:14:56.680
Ear-pho-nes!

00:14:59.470 --> 00:15:00.140
Huh?

00:15:00.140 --> 00:15:02.890
What do you think? Isn't it a wonderful name?

00:15:02.890 --> 00:15:03.420
Eh?

00:15:03.810 --> 00:15:05.150
Look, look, isn't the logo cool, too?

00:15:05.150 --> 00:15:06.340
Earphones
Look, look, isn't the logo cool, too?

00:15:06.340 --> 00:15:06.350
Earphones

00:15:08.860 --> 00:15:10.020
You already have the logo?

00:15:10.020 --> 00:15:11.150
It's so lame!

00:15:12.480 --> 00:15:15.320
Now, girls, things are going to get busy!

00:15:15.320 --> 00:15:18.110
At the beginning of next week,
we'll put the word out about the new unit,

00:15:18.110 --> 00:15:19.570
and then you'll have an interview
with an anime magazine,

00:15:19.570 --> 00:15:20.850
plan for your debut song,

00:15:20.850 --> 00:15:23.250
decide on your catchphrases
and practice singing,

00:15:23.250 --> 00:15:25.370
do a photoshoot for the CD cover,
and since we're making a music video,

00:15:25.370 --> 00:15:27.170
you'll have dance lessons, too!

00:15:31.610 --> 00:15:34.170
We're going to be a unit...?

00:15:34.170 --> 00:15:36.550
On top of that, we're having a CD debut...

00:15:36.550 --> 00:15:39.390
Things are happening so suddenly,
I can't keep up.

00:15:39.390 --> 00:15:41.680
Hey, why are you wimping out now?

00:15:41.680 --> 00:15:43.380
This is a great chance, you know!

00:15:43.810 --> 00:15:46.340
Let's fight our way up together,
the three of us!

00:15:49.250 --> 00:15:50.250
A chance...

00:15:51.610 --> 00:15:53.590
A unit? That's amazing-koro!

00:15:53.860 --> 00:16:00.180
Yeah. At first, I was really surprised,
but it's finally starting to sink in a little. I think?

00:16:00.990 --> 00:16:03.190
But you know, I can't let my guard down.

00:16:03.490 --> 00:16:05.110
Let your guard down-koro?

00:16:05.620 --> 00:16:09.460
I definitely can't let my guard down this time.

00:16:09.460 --> 00:16:11.460
I finally got this chance.

00:16:11.460 --> 00:16:14.420
I'll give it everything I've got,
just like Ginga-san said.

00:16:14.420 --> 00:16:18.450
Oh, I've been giving it my all up
until now, too, but even more so.

00:16:18.970 --> 00:16:21.260
Futaba-san, that's the spirit-koro!

00:16:21.260 --> 00:16:24.080
If you work hard, you'll be able
to have a concert someday, too!

00:16:24.080 --> 00:16:25.330
A concert?

00:16:25.330 --> 00:16:27.310
A concert, huh?

00:16:31.730 --> 00:16:33.930
L-Like this, maybe?

00:16:35.480 --> 00:16:40.430
Everyone! Thanks for coming today!

00:16:41.320 --> 00:16:46.240
Futaba! Futaba! Futaba! Futaba!

00:16:46.240 --> 00:16:49.130
Thank you!
Futaba! Futaba! Futaba! Futaba!

00:16:49.130 --> 00:16:49.160
Thank you!

00:16:50.270 --> 00:16:50.780
Huh?

00:16:52.190 --> 00:16:54.400
I-I was caught off guard by my flabby arm...

00:16:54.400 --> 00:16:55.660
What a pinch-koro!

00:16:55.660 --> 00:16:58.240
Sh-Should I start jogging tomorrow?

00:16:58.240 --> 00:16:59.720
And I need to go on a diet!

00:17:01.250 --> 00:17:05.000
It's finally here! It's here!
It's here! This is the time!

00:17:05.000 --> 00:17:10.560
I'll do anything to get my
big break as an idol seiyuu!

00:17:10.560 --> 00:17:11.550
Hm?

00:17:16.110 --> 00:17:18.570
Congrats! It's amazing that you're
forming a unit and having a CD debut!

00:17:18.880 --> 00:17:20.170
Dad...

00:17:21.340 --> 00:17:23.060
Thanks.

00:17:23.370 --> 00:17:25.370
All right! I'm gonna do it!

00:17:31.070 --> 00:17:32.070
Huh?!

00:17:33.940 --> 00:17:38.380
N-No, not that!

00:17:43.550 --> 00:17:46.970
Anyway, I have to do whatever I can right now!

00:17:46.970 --> 00:17:50.060
Even if I say that, it's not
like I need to go on a diet...

00:17:50.060 --> 00:17:54.900
And the song hasn't been decided yet,
so I can't practice singing or dancing...

00:17:54.900 --> 00:17:57.840
And it's so late, I can't go buy new clothes...

00:17:57.840 --> 00:18:00.490
But there has to be something!
I'm sure there is!

00:18:00.490 --> 00:18:02.860
Something that I can do right now!

00:18:02.860 --> 00:18:04.060
Oh, I know!

00:18:04.570 --> 00:18:06.980
A strawberry princess needs ringlets!

00:18:07.410 --> 00:18:13.230
l'll practice making ringlets!
l'll master the art of making perfect ringlets!

00:18:13.250 --> 00:18:13.750
Japanese Confectionery Kohana-ya

00:18:13.750 --> 00:18:19.300
Wow, now that I'm paying attention,
there are a lot of different units!

00:18:19.300 --> 00:18:25.090
I usually don't stand out too much,
so I never thought I'd be asked to be in a unit...

00:18:25.090 --> 00:18:26.410
Wait, what...?!

00:18:27.550 --> 00:18:29.170
S-Stage clothes...

00:18:29.170 --> 00:18:30.210
Like these!

00:18:30.210 --> 00:18:32.290
And these!

00:18:32.770 --> 00:18:34.800
They're very bold!

00:18:37.060 --> 00:18:38.230
Like this?

00:18:39.320 --> 00:18:41.260
And, like this?

00:18:49.950 --> 00:18:51.950
Congratulations, Ichinose-san.

00:18:51.950 --> 00:18:55.290
I think this is a very big chance for you.
Aren't you glad?

00:18:55.290 --> 00:18:56.360
Yes!

00:18:56.360 --> 00:19:00.130
And I don't want to just focus
on my work in the unit,

00:19:00.130 --> 00:19:03.300
I'll also work hard
to get another regular role.

00:19:03.300 --> 00:19:05.930
Yes, I would like to work hard, as well.

00:19:05.930 --> 00:19:06.370
Hm?

00:19:06.840 --> 00:19:10.390
It's my first time working with a unit.

00:19:10.390 --> 00:19:12.880
I'm a little anxious and nervous.

00:19:14.770 --> 00:19:15.860
What's the matter?

00:19:16.640 --> 00:19:19.810
I was just thinking that you're anxious, too.

00:19:19.810 --> 00:19:22.260
That it wasn't just me.

00:19:22.820 --> 00:19:27.770
Well, everyone gets nervous
their first time doing something.

00:19:29.370 --> 00:19:30.520
Everyone...?

00:19:30.830 --> 00:19:32.020
Yes.

00:19:34.500 --> 00:19:39.240
And you have an interview
with an anime magazine first thing.

00:19:39.960 --> 00:19:41.200
Okay!

00:19:45.670 --> 00:19:47.520
Good morning!

00:19:47.520 --> 00:19:48.080
Huh?

00:19:49.080 --> 00:19:51.430
Wait, lchigo, your hair!

00:19:51.430 --> 00:19:54.960
I haven't really figured out what works best,
so I think I overdid it a little.

00:19:55.520 --> 00:19:56.560
Does it look weird?

00:19:57.480 --> 00:19:59.440
No, it's cute.

00:19:59.440 --> 00:20:01.020
Yeah, it's wonderful!

00:20:01.020 --> 00:20:04.720
Thanks... Huh? Rin-chan?!

00:20:05.240 --> 00:20:07.720
It's unusual for you to wear a miniskirt.

00:20:08.610 --> 00:20:13.730
Yeah, I mean... It's practice.
I wanted to get used to being in a unit.

00:20:14.040 --> 00:20:15.620
Oh?

00:20:15.620 --> 00:20:19.920
I see. Everyone felt the same as me.

00:20:19.920 --> 00:20:22.400
What about you, Futaba? What's that?

00:20:22.400 --> 00:20:24.960
It's unusual to see you in sneakers, Futaba-san.

00:20:24.960 --> 00:20:30.080
Oh, yeah. I went on a diet because
of the unit, so I walked here today.

00:20:30.550 --> 00:20:33.460
It's like the more I think about it,
the more there is to worry about...

00:20:34.890 --> 00:20:36.680
I know. I know what you mean.

00:20:37.460 --> 00:20:38.960
Um...

00:20:39.640 --> 00:20:42.220
The three of us will be
together from now on, right?

00:20:43.470 --> 00:20:44.720
Yeah!

00:20:45.780 --> 00:20:47.260
I look forward to working with you!

00:20:49.110 --> 00:20:50.410
Same here.

00:20:51.160 --> 00:20:53.390
I look forward to working with you!

00:21:37.740 --> 00:21:40.690
Okay, can we take one last picture, please?

00:21:49.800 --> 00:21:52.050
It arrived at the office, so I brought it.

00:21:52.050 --> 00:21:53.510
The interview from the other day.

00:21:53.510 --> 00:21:55.510
Wow, it's out already?

00:21:55.510 --> 00:21:57.140
I want to see!

00:22:05.030 --> 00:22:09.980
New unit starting! They're called 'Earphones'! seiyuu idol unit 'Earphones' formed by three newcomer seiyuu
(Ichinose Futaba, Moesaki Ichigo, Kohana Rin)

00:22:30.390 --> 00:22:31.360
Fan mail time!

00:22:31.360 --> 00:22:31.860
Yay!

00:22:31.860 --> 00:22:33.340
"Since Earphones has finally been formed,

00:22:33.340 --> 00:22:34.560
please talk about your goals for the unit."

00:22:34.560 --> 00:22:35.260
Goals, huh?

00:22:35.260 --> 00:22:35.700
Yeah, yeah.

00:22:35.700 --> 00:22:37.340
I have so many, I don't know where to start!

00:22:37.340 --> 00:22:38.200
I'm going on a diet!

00:22:38.200 --> 00:22:39.400
I'll give it everything I have!

00:22:39.400 --> 00:22:40.600
We'll take over the world!

00:22:40.600 --> 00:22:41.300
And...

00:22:41.300 --> 00:22:43.500
Because the three of us will be together from now on...

00:22:43.500 --> 00:22:45.080
We're so happy!

00:22:45.510 --> 00:22:48.520
hajimete wa itsumo fuan desu
There's always anxiety when starting something

00:22:48.520 --> 00:22:52.700
demo sannin nara dekiru hazu
But I'm sure the three of us can do it

00:22:52.700 --> 00:22:55.900
ima made ijou ni ganbarimasu
We'll work harder than we ever have before!

00:22:55.900 --> 00:22:56.030
We have a request this week, too!
ima made ijou ni ganbarimasu
We'll work harder than we ever have before!

00:22:56.030 --> 00:22:58.360
We have a request this week, too!

00:22:58.360 --> 00:23:02.020
From <i>Bishoujo Senshi Sailor Moon Crystal,</i> it's "Moon Pride"!

00:23:02.020 --> 00:23:04.380
Shiny Make-up kagayaku
Shiny Make-up, shine!

00:23:04.380 --> 00:23:07.160
yo hoshizora wo atsumete
Gather in the starry sky

00:23:07.160 --> 00:23:10.080
tada mamorareru dake no
I'm not so frail

00:23:10.080 --> 00:23:13.510
kayowai sonzai ja nai wa
that I have to be protected

00:23:16.050 --> 00:23:17.930
Come on, we've still got more!

00:23:17.930 --> 00:23:19.350
Let's go!
